* Auto-generated testbench for voltage divider: R218/R219
* Expected Vout = 3.3 * 0.500000 = 1.6500 V
* Model: ideal passives (exact, unloaded)

VIN VCC 0 DC 3.3
R218 VCC n10V_GOOD 100k
R219 n10V_GOOD 0 100k

.control
op 
let vout_sim = v(n10V_GOOD)
let error_pct = abs(vout_sim - 1.65) / 1.65 * 100
echo "vout_sim=$&vout_sim error_pct=$&error_pct expected=1.65" > ShiroFOC/Manual_Rebuild/review/schematic_review_2026-09-26/spice_work/voltage-divider_R218_R219.out
quit
.endc

.end
